From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:50:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Refuse a scar from the dead and proposals from or to the
 dead

apply_scar joins DEAD_REFUSED, and both relationship propose paths
(REST and WebSocket) refuse a dead proposer or recipient with 409.
character_facts carries is_dead and name for the checks. A living
player's Circle page stamps a dead investigator's relationship paper
Dead and offers no Propose; a relationship from before the death still
shows, without Edit. FAQ.md, WEBSOCKET.md and QUIRKS.md updated.

Checked with new tests in test_ws_circle.py and test_circle_rest.py
(failing before), and test_ws_circle, test_circle_rest, test_access,
test_ws_marks and test_deletion all passing; frontend builds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
